Ahem.ttf is the Ahem font of the CSS test suites, copied unmodified from
https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/fonts/Ahem.ttf.

Todd Fahrner made the Ahem font for the W3C CSS Working Group and released
it into the public domain: anyone may use, copy, modify and distribute it,
for any purpose, without restriction.
